185:<span data-as="p">In cases where concurrent network calls are happening (many LLM calls!) it may be beneficial to use an asynchronous LLM client. Guardrails also natively supports asynchronous streaming calls.</span>
186:<span data-as="p">Learn more about async streaming <a class="link" href="/guardrails/concepts/streaming/async_streaming">here</a>.</span>
