641:  <section class="tex2jax_ignore mathjax_ignore" id="working-with-streaming-output">
642:<h1>Working with Streaming Output<a class="headerlink" href="#working-with-streaming-output" title="Link to this heading">#</a></h1>
643:<p>The microservice supports streaming output for both chat completions and completions.</p>
646:<p>You must enable streaming support in your guardrails configuration.
647:The key fields are <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">streaming.enabled</span></code> set to <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">True</span></code>, and the <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">chunk_size</span></code>, <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">context_size</span></code>, and <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">stream_first</span></code> configurable fields.</p>
652:<div class="highlight-yaml notranslate"><div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><span class="nt">rails</span><span class="p">:</span>
656:<span class="w">    </span><span class="nt">streaming</span><span class="p">:</span>
658:<span class="w">      </span><span class="nt">chunk_size</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="l l-Scalar l-Scalar-Plain">200</span>
660:<span class="w">      </span><span class="nt">stream_first</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="l l-Scalar l-Scalar-Plain">True</span>
667:<div class="highlight-json notranslate"><div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><span class="nt">&quot;rails&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span>
672:<span class="w">    </span><span class="nt">&quot;streaming&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span>
674:<span class="w">      </span><span class="nt">&quot;chunk_size&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="mi">200</span><span class="p">,</span>
676:<span class="w">      </span><span class="nt">&quot;stream_first&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">&quot;True&quot;</span>
684:<p>For information about the fields, refer to <a class="reference external" href="https://docs.nvidia.com/nemo/guardrails/latest/user-guides/configuration-guide.html#streaming-output-configuration">streaming output configuration</a>
685:in the NeMo Guardrails Toolkit documentation.</p>
686:<p>For information about managing guardrails configuration, refer to the demonstration guardrail configuration, <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">demo-self-check-output</span></code>, from
687:<a class="reference internal" href="manage-guardrail-configs/create-config.html"><span class="std std-doc">create a guardrail configuration</span></a>.</p>
691:<p>The primary purpose of streaming output is to reduce the time-to-first-token (TTFT) of the LLM response.
692:The following table shows some timing results for 20 requests using the GPT 4o model from OpenAI with and without streaming output and a very basic timing script.</p>
712:<tr class="row-even"><td><p>Streaming enabled</p></td>
719:<tr class="row-odd"><td><p>Streaming disabled</p></td>
729:<p>The streaming enabled configuration is faster by 85.14%, on average,
731:<p>The streaming configuration used the default configuration values: <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">chunk_size:</span> <span class="pre">200</span></code>, <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">context_size:</span> <span class="pre">50</span></code>, and <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">stream_first:</span> <span class="pre">True</span></code>.</p>
733:<section id="detecting-blocked-content-in-streaming-output">
734:<h2>Detecting Blocked Content in Streaming Output<a class="headerlink" href="#detecting-blocked-content-in-streaming-output" title="Link to this heading">#</a></h2>
735:<p>The microservice applies guardrail checks on chunks of tokens as they are streamed from the LLM.
736:If a chunk of tokens is blocked, the microservice returns a response in the following format:</p>
737:<div class="highlight-json notranslate"><div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><span class="p">{</span><span class="nt">&quot;error&quot;</span><span class="p">:{</span><span class="nt">&quot;message&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="s2">&quot;Blocked by &lt;rail-name&gt;&quot;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="nt">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="s2">&quot;guardrails_violation&quot;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="nt">&quot;param&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="s2">&quot;&lt;rails-name&gt;&quot;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="nt">&quot;code&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="s2">&quot;content_blocked&quot;</span><span class="p">}}</span>
743:<span class="w">    </span><span class="nt">&quot;message&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">&quot;Blocked by self check output rails.&quot;</span><span class="p">,</span>
744:<span class="w">    </span><span class="nt">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">&quot;guardrails_violation&quot;</span><span class="p">,</span>
752:<section id="chat-completions-with-streaming">
753:<h2>Chat Completions with Streaming<a class="headerlink" href="#chat-completions-with-streaming" title="Link to this heading">#</a></h2>
755:<li><p>Perform a POST request to the <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">/v1/guardrail/chat/completions</span></code> endpoint and specify <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">&quot;stream&quot;:</span> <span class="pre">True</span></code> in the request body.</p>
764:<span class="n">url</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&quot;</span><span class="si">{</span><span class="n">os</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">environ</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="s1">&#39;GUARDRAILS_BASE_URL&#39;</span><span class="p">]</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2">/v1/guardrail/chat/completions&quot;</span>
774:<span class="hll">    <span class="s2">&quot;guardrails&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="p">{</span>
779:<span class="hll">    <span class="s2">&quot;stream&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="kc">True</span>
782:<span class="k">with</span> <span class="n">requests</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">post</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">url</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">headers</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">headers</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">json</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">data</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">stream</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="kc">True</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="k">as</span> <span class="n">response</span><span class="p">:</span>
784:    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">chunk</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="n">response</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">iter_lines</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">decode_unicode</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="kc">True</span><span class="p">):</span>
785:        <span class="k">if</span> <span class="ow">not</span> <span class="n">chunk</span><span class="p">:</span>
788:            <span class="n">data</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">json</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">loads</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">chunk</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="nb">len</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&quot;data: &quot;</span><span class="p">):])</span>
792:            <span class="c1"># Add a check if content includes {&quot;error&quot;: {&quot;message&quot;: &quot;Blocked by &lt;rail-name&gt;&quot;...</span>
807:<span class="n">url</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&quot;</span><span class="si">{</span><span class="n">os</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">environ</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="s1">&#39;GUARDRAILS_BASE_URL&#39;</span><span class="p">]</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2">/v1/guardrail&quot;</span>
816:<span class="n">stream</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">client</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">chat</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">completions</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">create</span><span class="p">(</span>
825:<span class="hll">        <span class="s2">&quot;guardrails&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="p">{</span>
830:<span class="hll">    <span class="n">stream</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="kc">True</span>
833:<span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">chunk</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="n">stream</span><span class="p">:</span>
834:    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">chunk</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">choices</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">]</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">delta</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">content</span> <span class="ow">is</span> <span class="ow">not</span> <span class="kc">None</span><span class="p">:</span>
835:        <span class="c1"># Add a check if content includes {&quot;error&quot;: {&quot;message&quot;: &quot;Blocked by &lt;rail-name&gt;&quot;...</span>
836:        <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">chunk</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">choices</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">]</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">delta</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">content</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">end</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="s2">&quot;&quot;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">flush</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="kc">True</span><span class="p">)</span>
852:    <span class="n">openai_api_base</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&quot;</span><span class="si">{</span><span class="n">os</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">environ</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="s1">&#39;GUARDRAILS_BASE_URL&#39;</span><span class="p">]</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2">/v1/guardrail&quot;</span><span class="p">,</span>
856:<span class="hll">        <span class="s2">&quot;guardrails&quot;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="p">{</span>
863:<span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">chunk</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="n">model</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">stream</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&quot;Tell me about Cape Hatteras National Seashore in 50 words or less.&quot;</span><span class="p">):</span>
864:    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">chunk</span><span class="p">)</span>
865:    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">chunk</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">content</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">end</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="s2">&quot;&quot;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">flush</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="kc">True</span><span class="p">)</span>
891:        <p class="prev-next-title">Running Inference with Guardrails</p>
899:        <p class="prev-next-title">Guardrails Reference</p>
