707:  <section class="tex2jax_ignore mathjax_ignore" id="output-streaming-configuration">
708:<h1>Output Streaming Configuration<a class="headerlink" href="#output-streaming-configuration" title="Link to this heading">#</a></h1>
709:<p>The NeMo Guardrails library supports streaming out of the box when using the <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">stream_async()</span></code> method. No configuration is required to enable basic streaming.</p>
710:<p>When you have <strong>output rails</strong> configured, you need to explicitly enable streaming for them to process tokens in chunked mode.</p>
713:<p>When using streaming with output rails:</p>
718:<span class="w">    </span><span class="nt">streaming</span><span class="p">:</span>
720:<span class="w">      </span><span class="nt">chunk_size</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="l l-Scalar l-Scalar-Plain">200</span>
721:<span class="w">      </span><span class="nt">context_size</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="l l-Scalar l-Scalar-Plain">50</span>
725:<section id="streaming-configuration-details">
726:<h2>Streaming Configuration Details<a class="headerlink" href="#streaming-configuration-details" title="Link to this heading">#</a></h2>
727:<p>The following guides provide detailed documentation for streaming configuration.</p>
734:Streaming LLM Responses</div>
735:<p class="sd-card-text">Enable and use streaming mode for LLM responses in real-time in the NeMo Guardrails library.</p>
740:<a class="sd-stretched-link sd-hide-link-text reference internal" href="global-streaming.html"><span class="doc">Streaming LLM Responses in Real-Time</span></a></div>
746:Output Rail Streaming</div>
